Today is Tuesday.
In the morning, we have our short team meeting.
Suresh, Rohan, Priya, Vikram, and I are in the meeting.
We are all standing.
Suresh starts the meeting.
"Maya, have you seen the new project's information?" Suresh asks.
I say yes.
"Yes Suresh, I have read the client's requirements yesterday," I say.
"I have prepared my technical plan," I continue.
I explain my work to the team.
"I am going to work on the database first."
"I have also checked the old code," I say.
"Great, Maya."
"This plan is excellent," Suresh says.
After that, Priya talks about the design.
Vikram tells about the testing work.
Our meeting lasts only fifteen minutes.
I have received a clear direction for the work now.
I go back to my seat with confidence.
And I start my new work.
